     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>I am trying to create UI elements using uiOutput/renderUI that are inline.  Simple example that doesn&#39;t work is:</div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Would like this&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fooo&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;to be all on one line.&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$fooo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;foo&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Foo&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>Following <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/28749693/shiny-r-aligning-buttons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/28749693/shiny-r-aligning-buttons&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391784923000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a1ED1hIE685eMfnzVjz3I\">some advice on stackoverflow,</a> I have tried wrapping uiOutput elements in </div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">div</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">style</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;display:inline-block&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fooo&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;float:right&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>etc., to no avail.  I notice that renderUI output contains a line that looks tantalizing:</div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outputId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">inline</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> container </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">inline</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> span </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> div</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...)</span></div></code></div><p><span><br></span></p><p><span>but is there any way to change to inline=TRUE?</span></p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
